  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda Clean Cooking Supply Chain Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to reduce both (i) the economic burden on households and (ii) the negative impacts on the environmentcomma of the inefficient use of solid biomass fuels for cooking by fostering sales and adoption of cleaner and more efficient cooking technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
